<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es-VE">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Recibo de Pago — {{ worker.nombres }} {{ worker.apellidos }} ({{ worker.cedulaTipo }}-{{ worker.cedulaNumero }})</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary-color: {{ primaryColor | default("#0d47a1") }};
      --text-dark: #0f172a;
      --text-medium: #334155;
      --text-light: #64748b;
      --border-color: #cbd5e1;
      --bg-light: #f8fafc;
      --highlight-bg: #f1f5f9;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    @page {
      size: A4 portrait;
      margin: 10mm;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text-dark);
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 2mm 5mm;
      max-width: 190mm;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 11.5px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .no-print {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: #eff6ff;
      border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .btn-print {
      background: var(--primary-color);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-back {
      color: #1e40af;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    @media print {
      .no-print { display: none !important; }
      body { padding: 0; }
    }

    /* Membrete Oficial */
    .header-box {
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-color);
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .institution-name {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary-color);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .institution-rif {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-medium);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .doc-title-badge {
      text-align: right;
    }
    .doc-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-dark);
    }
    .doc-period {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-medium);
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    /* Datos del Trabajador */
    .worker-card {
      background: var(--bg-light);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 6px 12px;
    }
    .worker-field-label {
      font-size: 9px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-light);
    }
    .worker-field-value {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-dark);
    }

    /* Tabla de Conceptos Asignaciones vs Deducciones */
    .payroll-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 4px 6px;
      background: var(--highlight-bg);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--primary-color);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    table.concept-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    table.concept-table th {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 4px 6px;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 9.5px;
      color: var(--text-light);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    table.concept-table td {
      padding: 4.5px 6px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed #e2e8f0;
    }
    table.concept-table td.amount {
      text-align: right;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .subtotal-row td {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-bottom: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding-top: 6px;
      font-size: 11.5px;
    }

    /* Resumen Neto Final */
    .summary-box {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      background: var(--bg-light);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .neto-label {
      font-size: 11.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .neto-amount {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    /* Firmas Oficiales */
    .signatures-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .sign-box {
      text-align: center;
    }
    .sign-line {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--text-dark);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .sign-role {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .sign-name {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--text-medium);
    }

    .legal-footer {
      font-size: 8.5px;
      color: var(--text-light);
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding-top: 6px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="no-print">
    <div>
      <strong>Vista previa del recibo oficial (A4)</strong>
      <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #475569; margin-left: 0.5rem;">Presione el botón o use Ctrl+P para imprimir / exportar en PDF</span>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; align-items: center;">
      <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn-back">&larr; Volver</a>
      <button class="btn-print" onclick="window.print()">Imprimir Recibo (PDF)</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Membrete Oficial -->
  <div class="header-box">
    <div>
      <div class="institution-name">{{ institutionName | default("República Bolivariana de Venezuela") }}</div>
      <div class="institution-rif">RIF: {{ institutionRif | default("G-20000000-0") }} &bull; Órgano / Ente Adscrito</div>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-title-badge">
      <div class="doc-title">Recibo de Pago de Nómina</div>
      <div class="doc-period">Período: {{ periodStart }} al {{ periodEnd }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Ficha del Trabajador -->
  <div class="worker-card">
    <div>
      <div class="worker-field-label">Trabajador</div>
      <div class="worker-field-value">{{ worker.nombres }} {{ worker.apellidos }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="worker-field-label">Cédula de Identidad</div>
      <div class="worker-field-value">{{ worker.cedulaTipo }}-{{ worker.cedulaNumero }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="worker-field-label">Cargo Desempeñado</div>
      <div class="worker-field-value">{{ worker.cargo | default("Analista") }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="worker-field-label">Departamento / Área</div>
      <div class="worker-field-value">{{ worker.departamento | default("Sede Principal") }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="worker-field-label">Fecha de Ingreso</div>
      <div class="worker-field-value">{{ worker.fechaIngreso }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="worker-field-label">Cuenta Bancaria</div>
      <div class="worker-field-value">{{ worker.cuentaBancaria | default("0102-****-****-****") }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Desglose Asignaciones y Deducciones -->
  <div class="payroll-grid">
    <!-- Asignaciones -->
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">Asignaciones (Haberes)</div>
      <table class="concept-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Concepto</th>
            <th scope="col" style="text-align: right;">Monto (Bs.)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for asig in asignaciones %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ asig.concepto }}</td>
            <td class="amount">{{ asig.monto }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
          <tr class="subtotal-row">
            <td>Total Asignaciones:</td>
            <td class="amount" style="color: #16a34a;">Bs. {{ totalAsignaciones }}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Deducciones -->
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">Deducciones (Retenciones)</div>
      <table class="concept-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Concepto</th>
            <th scope="col" style="text-align: right;">Monto (Bs.)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for ded in deducciones %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ ded.concepto }}</td>
            <td class="amount">{{ ded.monto }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
          <tr class="subtotal-row">
            <td>Total Deducciones:</td>
            <td class="amount" style="color: #dc2626;">Bs. {{ totalDeducciones }}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Resumen Neto -->
  <div class="summary-box">
    <div>
      <div class="neto-label">Neto Efectivo a Cobrar:</div>
      <div style="font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--text-light); margin-top: 1px;">Liquidación mediante transferencia bancaria</div>
    </div>
    <div class="neto-amount">Bs. {{ totalNeto }}</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Firmas -->
  <div class="signatures-grid">
    <div class="sign-box">
      <div class="sign-line"></div>
      <div class="sign-role">Talento Humano / Nómina</div>
      <div class="sign-name">Procesado y Autorizado</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sign-box">
      <div class="sign-line"></div>
      <div class="sign-role">Firma del Trabajador</div>
      <div class="sign-name">Conforme Art. 106 LOTTT</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Pie Legal -->
  <div class="legal-footer">
    Recibo emitido de conformidad con el Artículo 106 de la Ley Orgánica del Trabajo, los Trabajadores y las Trabajadoras (LOTTT).
    Constancia de pago inmutable generada electrónicamente por el sistema institucional TalentoVe.
  </div>

</body>
</html>
